    '🛶',
    145, 200, 6.0, 'GO',
    'Gal Oya National Park Safari Guide | Island Culture Travels',
    'Plan a Gal Oya safari: Sri Lanka\'s only walking safari with indigenous Vedda trackers, boat safaris on the reservoir, and elephants swimming between islands.',
    54, 1, 1, 'Wildlife Safari',
