-- 9. MINNERIYA & KAUDULLA NATIONAL PARK
-- ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

CALL ict_insert_dest_if_missing(
    'Minneriya & Kaudulla National Park',
    'minneriya',
    'Home to the famous Elephant Gathering — up to 300 wild elephants congregating around an ancient reservoir in the dry season.',
    'Minneriya and Kaudulla are two adjacent national parks in the North Central Province, famous for the "Elephant Gathering" — one of the best wildlife spectacles in Asia. During the dry season (July to October), the water in the ancient Minneriya Tank recedes, creating rich grazing grounds on the exposed bed. Herds of elephants — sometimes 200 to 300 individuals — gather to feed. The sight is extraordinary: elephants of all ages, from tiny calves to massive tuskers, spreading across the green plain. Kaudulla, connected by a wildlife corridor, serves as an overflow and is often better when Minneriya is busy. Both parks offer reliable, close-up elephant viewing that can be done as a half-day trip from Sigiriya or Habarana.',
    'The elephant gathering is the obvious draw — it is one of the best wildlife photography opportunities in Asia. But the parks are also excellent for birding: painted storks, openbill storks, crested hawk-eagles, and the endemic Sri Lankan junglefowl. The landscape of the tank and surrounding forest is beautiful in the golden light. And the proximity to Sigiriya makes it an effortless add-on to any Cultural Triangle itinerary.',
    'Morning or afternoon jeep safari in Minneriya (allows 2-3 hours). Elephant photography at the tank bed during the gathering season. Visit Kaudulla if Minneriya is busy — the corridor allows elephants to move between parks. Birdwatching at the water\'s edge. Combine with a Sigiriya climb on the same day. Sunset viewing from the park boundary. Drive the Habarana road for the chance of wild elephants on the roadside.',
    'The famous Elephant Gathering happens between July and October. June and November are shoulder months with decent sightings. December to May is the wet season — elephants disperse and sightings are less predictable. The afternoon safari (2-6 PM) is best for the gathering as elephants emerge to graze.',
    'About 180 kilometres from Colombo — 4 hours by car. The parks are 10-15 km from Sigiriya and Habarana. From Colombo, drive via Dambulla to Habarana. Private transport from Sigiriya takes 20 minutes. From Colombo, allow 4 hours door-to-park.',
    'Half a day is sufficient. Visit as an afternoon safari from a Sigiriya/Habarana base. Most visitors do: morning at Sigiriya, afternoon at Minneriya. One night in the area allows for both.',
    'Stay in Sigiriya or Habarana. Sigiriya has the best selection of hotels — from jungle lodges (Jetwing Vil Uyana, Aliya Resort) to budget-friendly options. Habarana has more resort-style hotels. Both are within 20 minutes of the park entrance.',
    'The best park on a given day can vary — Minneriya or Kaudulla. A good driver will know which has the most activity. Book through a recommended operator; the jeeps vary in quality. The gathering is not guaranteed every day — it depends on the water level. Bring a mask for dust on the open jeep. The mosquitoes near the tank at dusk are numerous.',
    '[{"q":"What is the Elephant Gathering?","a":"During the dry season (Jul-Oct), hundreds of elephants gather on the receding tank bed to graze — one of Asia\'s great wildlife spectacles."},{"q":"Can I visit both parks in one day?","a":"Yes, if you do a morning and afternoon safari, but one safari is usually enough to see elephants."},{"q":"Which park is better, Minneriya or Kaudulla?","a":"It depends on the season and water level. A good driver will choose the best park on the day."}]',
    'Plan Your Minneriya Elephant Gathering Safari',
    'We can book your private jeep safari to the Elephant Gathering at Minneriya or Kaudulla — timed for the best light and activity.',
    'North Central Province',
    '27–34°C',
    'Wildlife Safari',
    'Half day',
    'Half day',
    'wildlife',
    'Wildlife',
    '🐘',
    118, 134, 6.0, 'M',
    'Minneriya & Kaudulla Elephant Gathering Guide | Island Culture Travels',
    'Plan your Minneriya or Kaudulla elephant safari from Sigiriya. Witness the famous Elephant Gathering — up to 300 wild elephants — with private jeep transfers.',
    58, 1, 1, 'Wildlife Safari',
    'The famous Elephant Gathering — hundreds of wild elephants on the tank bed',
    'Sigiriya, Dambulla, Habarana, Polonnaruwa',
    'Sigiriya: 15 min. Habarana: 10 min. Dambulla: 30 min. Polonnaruwa: 1 hr. Colombo: 4 hrs.',
