    '{"nationalities":["UK","GER","AUS"],"top_activities":["Flamingo watching","Bird photography","Nature walks","Crocodile spotting"],"traveler_types":["nature","birding","photographer","eco"]}',
    '[{"platform":"TripAdvisor","score":"4.5","url":"","notes":"Best birding park in Sri Lanka"},{"platform":"GetYourGuide","score":"4.6","url":"","notes":"Excellent for bird photography"}]',
    'Easy (safari)',
    'Car',
    'Quiet',
    'Seasonality: Migratory birds arrive in winter (Nov-Mar). Logistical Effort: Very close to Yala/Tangalle; easy to combine. Less about "big mammals," more about birds. Essential to bring binoculars.',
    '[{"name":"Yala","slug":"yala","type":"wildlife","distance":"30 min"},{"name":"Tangalle","slug":"tangalle","type":"beach","distance":"45 min"},{"name":"Kalamatiya","type":"birding","distance":"15 min"}]',
